# Official installers that are piped into a shell by design.
# Format: host [path]. Exact https host. No path, or /, means the root path
# only. A path ending in / matches that directory and below; any other path
# must match exactly. Add your own in
# ~/.config/clickfix-guard/allow.txt (same format).
#
# Where the agent can ask (Claude Code, Grok) an allowlisted command still asks
# the user. Codex has no ask, so there it is allowed. CLICKFIX_GUARD=block
# ignores the allowlist.
#
# Never add a directory prefix on raw.githubusercontent.com: it also serves
# commits from forks by SHA, so only exact paths on a fixed ref are safe.
raw.githubusercontent.com /Homebrew/install/HEAD/install.sh
sh.rustup.rs /
astral.sh /uv/
